  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Introduced LogEngine with asynchronous channel-based batching pipeline.\n- Added multiple sinks: ConsoleLogTarget, FileLogTarget, and ChannelFileLogTarget.\n- Implemented BatchFileLogTarget for high-throughput file I/O with low contention.\n- Added flexible options (FileLogOptions, BatchFileLogOptions, EmailLogOptions) for configuration tuning.\n- Integrated LogFormatter and LogDistributor for extensible message routing.\n- Added NLogix facade for simplified static logging entry points and extensions.\n- Improved async handling, internal exception safety, and batching performance.\n- General cleanup, documentation updates, and unit test enhancements.",
